 to meet growing demand, while rapidly decarbonizing for a sustainable future. With nearly a century of market and technology leadership, SLB is well positioned and committed to being a leader in providing solutions to address this trilemma.","zh":null},{"en":"SLB is primarily organized under four Divisions that combine and integrate SLB's technologies, enhancing our ability to support the emerging long-term growth opportunities in each of these market segments. The four Divisions are:","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"SLB's primary customers are national oil companies, large integrated oil companies, and independent operators. No single customer exceeded 10% of SLB's consolidated revenue during each of 2025, 2024, and 2023.","zh":null},{"en":"SLB is subject to numerous environmental and other governmental and regulatory requirements related to its operations worldwide. For additional details see \"Item 1(a). Risk Factors – Legal and Regulatory Risks,\" which is incorporated by reference in this Item 1.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"The principal methods of competition within the energy services industry are technological innovation, quality of service, and price differentiation. These factors vary geographically and are dependent upon the different services and products that SLB offers. SLB has numerous competitors, both large and small.","zh":null},{"en":"SLB owns or controls one of the industry's leading portfolios of intellectual property, including but not limited to patents, proprietary information, trade secrets, and software tools and applications that, in the aggregate, are material to SLB's business. While SLB seeks and holds a significant number of patents covering various products and processes, no particular patent or group of patents is material to SLB's business.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Production Systems","val":13325000000,"zh":"Production Systems"},{"name":"Well Construction","val":11856000000,"zh":"Well Construction"},{"name":"Reservoir Performance","val":6820000000,"zh":"Reservoir Performance"},{"name":"Digital Integration","val":2660000000,"zh":"Digital Integration"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":1987000000,"zh":"All Other Segments"}],"total":35708000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":21200000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Product","val":14508000000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":35708000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":27942000000,"zh":"Non Us"},{"name":"Middle East","val":12218000000,"zh":"中東"},{"name":"Europe Africa","val":9572000000,"zh":"Europe Africa"},{"name":"North America","val":7515000000,"zh":"North America"},{"name":"US","val":6300000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Latin America","val":6152000000,"zh":"Latin America"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":251000000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":35708000000}},"peers":["HAL","RIG","COP","OXY","DVN"]}}